## Known live deltas vs this doc
Surface, do not hide, do not "fix" unless asked:
SQLite in production; no product variants; integer PKs not UUID; API not versioned (`/api` not `/api/v1`); STORE extra role; loyalty/marketing/omnichannel/forecast incomplete; AI is KB+chat not full BOS assistant; payment integrations not live (billing is bank requisites).

## Core POS (Phase 1 — do not regress)
- Prices are tax-inclusive. QQS = `total * vat_percent / (100 + vat_percent)` in `app/money.py`. Receipt and reports use `tax_total`.
- CASHIER discount cannot exceed 10% of subtotal. Sale discounts are audited.
- Do not DELETE a completed sale. Return is the reversal path. Exchange is return + new sale until approved.
- POS checkout is atomic; `idempotency_key` prevents double submit.

## Regression after changes
Existing features, API, DB, auth, tenant isolation, POS checkout.
